    "div" : "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Requirements AuditEventAccess</b></p><a name=\"AuditEventAccess\"> </a><a name=\"hcAuditEventAccess\"> </a><p>These requirements apply to the actor <a href=\"ActorDefinition-VHLSharer.html\">VHL Sharer</a></p><p>These requirements derive from <a href=\"Requirements-RecordAccessToHealthData.html\">Record Access to Health Data</a></p><table class=\"grid\"/></div>"
